cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: pylibs-stats
abstract: >-
  Statistical processing of LIBS (Laser-Induced Breakdown Spectroscopy)
  imaging data. Extracts named features from raw acquisitions, computes
  one- and two-dimensional distribution statistics per feature, correlates
  and regresses those statistics across samples against external sample
  properties, and applies the fitted relationships back onto individual
  images as quantification maps. Exposed as a command-line interface, a
  small domain-specific language, and a Python API over one shared core.

